        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-SD-E86570, Discus Crystal Shower Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis beautiful 1-3/4\" diameter classic style glass shower door knob is easy to grab because of its large size and it compliments any style decor from traditional to modern.  Single knob kits are normally used on sliding glass shower doors but can also be used on one side of a swing glass door. They have a matching finish screw cover for a clean looking installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Discus Crystal Shower Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Crystal with Brass Stem</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Ring Diameter:  1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
